        "subject": "Financial Accounting",
        "topic": "Non-Profit Accounting",
        "question_type": "Practical",
        "exam_year": "2018",
        "question_text": "<p>A non-profit organization received subscriptions of \u20b512,000 during the year. Subscriptions in arrears at the beginning were \u20b51,000, and at the end were \u20b51,500. Subscriptions in advance at the beginning were \u20b5500, and at the end were \u20b5800. What is the income from subscriptions for the year?</p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>To calculate income from subscriptions:<br>1. Start with subscriptions received: \u20b512,000.<br>2. Add subscriptions in arrears at the end: \u20b512,000 + \u20b51,500 = \u20b513,500.<br>3. Subtract subscriptions in arrears at the beginning: \u20b513,500 - \u20b51,000 = \u20b512,500.<br>4. Subtract subscriptions in advance at the end: \u20b512,500 - \u20b5800 = \u20b511,700.<br>5. Add subscriptions in advance at the beginning: \u20b511,700 + \u20b5500 = <b>\u20b512,200</b>.</p>",
